  "problem": "Which of the following diagrams represents a perpendicular bisector of $\\overline{AB}?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14173511/assets/90e49cf78c7fb86b6f5a8c33b3e5bd28279248f791757a2351ddb86296d79d72.png)",
